WEBVTT

00:00:04.430 --> 00:00:05.510
Wait...

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:08.290
Wait up, Kaoruko!

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:16.750
Oh, come on, Azuma. If you're 
gonna cry, then just go home.

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:19.900
No way!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:25.130
Then quit whining and keep up.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:30.010
Remember, I'm gonna be 
getting <i>that</i> from Mommy.

00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:33.830
I'm... I'm the one she's giving it to!

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:35.760
Nope. You'll never get it, Azuma.

00:00:39.820 --> 00:00:41.090
Why not?

00:00:41.090 --> 00:00:42.020
Because...

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:47.140
You can't do this, can you?

00:01:00.180 --> 00:01:03.030
Awesome, right? You'd better not tell Mommy.

00:01:03.030 --> 00:01:04.660
You'll regret it if you do.

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:07.450
Okay...

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:11.510
Here. This is yours.

00:01:11.930 --> 00:01:13.920
I don't want that stupid toy.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.810
There he is! Oubu!

00:01:36.730 --> 00:01:38.610
Come on, Kaoruko.

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.780
Let's go back now.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:01.410
It smells just like Mommy...

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:06.440
Don't, Kaoruko! Mom said it's dangerous!

00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.270
That hurts! Stop it, Azuma!

00:02:12.130 --> 00:02:15.250
Mom! Mom!

00:02:15.490 --> 00:02:17.250
Mom!

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:38.920
Go away. You'll scare off the fish.

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:45.240
All right. This should be enough.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.700
Azuma! Kaoruko! I'm home!

00:03:04.830 --> 00:03:07.860
Welcome home!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.250
Welcome home!

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:15.380
Thanks.

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:26.350
Oh, my. Looks like you two are having fun.

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:31.350
Mommy! Welcome home!

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:34.190
Mommy! Mommy!

00:03:33.390 --> 00:03:35.850
Welcome home, Mom!

00:03:37.630 --> 00:03:39.040
You're early today.

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:46.430
It'd be nice if the Buranki 
were like this every day.

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:53.570
Happy birthday! Happy birthday!

00:03:53.570 --> 00:03:58.230
Happy birthday, Azuma and Kaoruko!

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:04.450
They're both six today, huh?

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:07.640
Hey! Why'd you blow them out?!

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.280
Yes.

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.070
A Buranki!

00:05:01.580 --> 00:05:04.610
Mommy, are the Buranki asleep?

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:08.560
Yes. They walk around in their sleep.

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.030
That's why we must never wake them.

00:05:11.030 --> 00:05:13.620
What happens if they wake up?

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:18.630
Don't worry. I'll be keeping an eye out.

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:22.940
Now, let's go finish our dinner.

00:05:27.810 --> 00:05:30.360
You won't last long like this.

00:05:30.360 --> 00:05:33.340
You should go down to the 
surface and get checked out.

00:05:33.810 --> 00:05:36.140
I can't leave right now.

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:39.130
The Buranki have been more active lately.

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:43.360
If only I had the power that 
you and the kids have...

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:47.230
Don't worry. I'll manage one way or another.

00:05:50.130 --> 00:05:54.410
Maybe they should start practicing 
how to use Oubu tomorrow.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.110
Yeah, I agree.

00:06:15.530 --> 00:06:16.740
Kaoruko?

00:06:21.330 --> 00:06:22.480
Oh, no...

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.950
Did she go to see Oubu?

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:27.830
It won't be like last time.

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:33.740
<i>Mom told us to stay away from Oubu!</i>

00:06:34.280 --> 00:06:37.990
<i>So why would she go, 
after it was so scary last time?</i>

00:06:41.930 --> 00:06:44.170
Mommy can't use Oubu anymore.

00:06:44.790 --> 00:06:47.830
So I'll use it for her!

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:53.780
Why won't you move?

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:55.930
Why?! Come on, move!

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:59.440
Or can't you do what I tell you to?

00:06:59.650 --> 00:07:00.560
Kaoruko!

00:07:01.100 --> 00:07:02.660
What are you doing?

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.730
Too bad for you, Azuma.

00:07:06.730 --> 00:07:08.730
I'm the one who'll ride Oubu.

00:07:08.730 --> 00:07:11.230
And then I'm gonna kill all the Buranki.

00:07:11.770 --> 00:07:12.950
You can't!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.150
I'll save the world with 
Oubu, like Mommy did.

00:07:17.150 --> 00:07:18.080
Kaoruko!

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:20.500
You don't understand anything, Azuma!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:23.080
If I don't hurry, Mommy's going to die!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:34.970
That's...

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:39.590
Azuma! Kaoruko!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:41.030
If you're there, answer us!

00:07:45.020 --> 00:07:46.660
Azuma! Kaoruko!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:49.210
Mom...

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:50.040
Mommy! Mommy!

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.470
It's all right now. It'll be all right.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:09.130
Migiwa, let's go home for now.

00:08:14.510 --> 00:08:16.530
Azuma, Kaoruko.

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:18.810
Come down. There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:22.920
There was a Buranki under our house?

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:26.760
It's all right.
This Buranki is sound asleep.

00:08:28.630 --> 00:08:30.600
How does it look?

00:08:31.740 --> 00:08:32.400
Migiwa?

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:34.790
It's all right.

00:08:35.230 --> 00:08:36.840
I'll do something about it.

00:08:40.990 --> 00:08:44.920
Azuma, Kaoruko, I want you 
both to listen closely.

00:08:45.260 --> 00:08:49.600
You're going to go to where 
your dad and I were born.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.810
What about you, Mommy? 
Aren't you going with us?

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:56.230
There's something I need to do here.

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:57.680
No, Mom!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.250
Come with us!

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:02.670
Now, Azuma, you're the big brother.

00:09:02.670 --> 00:09:03.850
You must be strong.

00:09:04.360 --> 00:09:08.550
I'm sorry, Mommy! I... I...

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:09.410
It's okay.

00:09:10.060 --> 00:09:12.480
You were trying to help me.

00:09:12.480 --> 00:09:14.080
I know that.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:15.070
Mommy...

00:09:16.540 --> 00:09:20.210
If you run into any 
trouble, just join hands.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:24.080
If you two work together, 
you can handle anything.

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.260
Mommy?

00:09:26.840 --> 00:09:28.580
Take care of them.

00:09:31.350 --> 00:09:33.460
Mom? Mom!

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.070
Mommy! Mommy!

00:09:36.070 --> 00:09:37.930
I love you, Azuma.

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.740
I love you, Kaoruko.

00:09:38.790 --> 00:09:40.980
No! Don't go!

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.830
Mommy! Mommy!

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.830
Mom! Mom!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:48.020
Mom! Mom!

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:48.020
Mommy! Mommy!

00:09:55.320 --> 00:09:58.070
I know the two of you will be fine.

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:46.000
<b><i>Bubuki Buranki</i></b>

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:46.000
<b>Episode 1
The Witch's Son</b>

00:11:00.990 --> 00:11:01.660
Whoa...

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:02.880
Hey!

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.910
Don't move. Hands in the air.

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:25.280
Damn, he gave us a hell of a time.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.570
Kazuki Azuma?

00:11:28.910 --> 00:11:30.790
That's the same family name as that witch.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.040
She's not a witch.

00:11:34.300 --> 00:11:35.320
Huh?

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:38.800
She's not a witch!

00:11:41.400 --> 00:11:43.590
Azuma-kun's late.

00:11:43.590 --> 00:11:46.240
He should have gotten my letter.

00:11:46.910 --> 00:11:50.890
He hasn't been in Japan for a long 
time. I wonder if he's lost.

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:56.940
Azuma-kun?

00:12:02.820 --> 00:12:06.360
Th-Th-This is terrible!

00:12:07.550 --> 00:12:09.830
<i>Ten years have passed since 
that unprecedented tragedy.</i>

00:12:10.530 --> 00:12:13.530
<i>I'm sure life has calmed 
down for all of you,</i>

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.750
<i>and you are once again 
enjoying days of peace.</i>

00:12:17.080 --> 00:12:20.710
<i>However, that peace is short-lived.</i>

00:12:20.960 --> 00:12:21.630
<i>Uh...</i>

00:12:32.730 --> 00:12:40.920
<i>We must take care to ensure that such 
a tragedy does not happen again.</i>

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:37.830
Reoko-sama, is this seat all right?

00:12:42.700 --> 00:12:46.870
Rotten luck to get brought in the day you 
come back to Japan, eh, witch's son?

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:50.650
I never would've believed you 
were really Kazuki Migiwa's kid.

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:53.370
Then you must have the heart.

00:12:54.680 --> 00:12:57.880
So, where are you hiding that heart?

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:00.840
What heart?

00:13:01.310 --> 00:13:02.670
Trying to play dumb?

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:06.140
The heart! The heart Bubuki!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.390
We have a reading on it!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:12.480
What's this about a heart and "Bubuki"?

00:13:13.060 --> 00:13:14.490
I don't get it.

00:13:14.940 --> 00:13:16.810
You saw the memorial ceremony, didn't you?

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:22.650
On this day ten years ago, your mother 
sent a Buranki down to Earth.

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:25.320
Do you realize how much damage that caused?

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:28.450
No... My mom...

00:13:28.450 --> 00:13:29.580
My mom...

00:13:31.580 --> 00:13:33.910
Give us the heart!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:37.580
Cough up the Bubuki,
you damned witch's spawn!

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:52.430
A Bubuki?!

00:13:53.600 --> 00:13:54.310
Bubuki?

00:14:06.300 --> 00:14:08.310
Righty-chan!

00:14:09.400 --> 00:14:12.160
Jeez... Stay! Stay!

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:13.950
Calm down, Righty-chan!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:15.710
Kogane-chan?

00:14:16.750 --> 00:14:18.840
Yeah! Long time no see, A-chan!

00:14:19.180 --> 00:14:21.490
Yeah, it really has been ages!

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:30.610
Kogane-chan, what is this?

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:33.970
It's a Bubuki. The hand of a Buranki.

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:35.660
Bubuki...

00:14:36.010 --> 00:14:36.960
Buranki?

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:38.740
A hand?

00:14:40.930 --> 00:14:43.320
Ah... We have to get out of here!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.250
I'll explain it better later!

00:14:47.370 --> 00:14:48.900
Okay, sure.

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:17.180
Well, that should do it.

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.690
I want to eat some grass.

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:24.650
I'll give you all the grass 
you want to eat later.

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:28.630
And lots of eggplants, please!

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:31.700
Sure, sure. Eggplants. No problem.

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:35.560
I finally found where it was hidden.

00:15:35.560 --> 00:15:37.860
I swear I'll get it back.

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:41.900
<i>"Anger and grief will yield nothing."</i>

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.530
A Bubuki user has broken through the gate.

00:15:42.440 --> 00:15:44.530
<i>"We should just forget all that."</i>

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.860
<i>I'm sure many of you feel that way.</i>

00:15:47.600 --> 00:15:50.730
<i>However, over these ten years,</i>

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:52.150
<i>I have not...</i>

00:15:57.430 --> 00:16:00.010
<i>You loathsome monsters...</i>

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:04.190
I can't believe they 
chose today of all days.

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:09.010
Reoko-sama, would you
leave those brats to me?

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:12.330
Do as you please, Shuusaku.

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:13.920
Give it your best effort.

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:24.280
I've got this!

00:16:31.280 --> 00:16:33.930
Sorry! I guess that was a bit much!

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.530
Huh? Hii-kun?

00:16:46.530 --> 00:16:49.380
Kogane, who told you to go nuts like that?

00:16:49.380 --> 00:16:52.900
B-But A-chan got taken in by the police.

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:03.120
A-chan, this is the guy I 
wanted you to meet today.

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.920
I'm Nono Hiiragi. I'm a Bubuki user.

00:17:06.200 --> 00:17:08.670
I've been waiting for you, coward.

00:17:09.550 --> 00:17:11.300
Hey! Hii-kun!

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.010
Well, it's true.

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:16.090
He's a wimp who ran to hide outside 
the country all this time.

00:17:16.490 --> 00:17:19.910
I didn't run. I've been 
searching the whole time.

00:17:19.910 --> 00:17:22.080
Searching? For what?

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.150
Nothing I want to tell anyone about.

00:17:24.650 --> 00:17:27.060
Hmph. Are you trying to mock me?

00:17:27.550 --> 00:17:31.150
Well, whatever. If the 
Bubuki Police caught you,

00:17:31.150 --> 00:17:33.240
they told you about ten years ago, right?

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.110
Yeah.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:36.410
Everything they say is a big fat lie.

00:17:37.050 --> 00:17:40.110
History was rewritten by Banryuu Reoko,

00:17:40.110 --> 00:17:43.790
and your mother, Migiwa,
was framed as a mass murderer.

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:48.640
We're going to revive your 
mother's Buranki, Oubu,

00:17:48.640 --> 00:17:50.580
and show the world the truth.

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:52.760
Oubu? You found Oubu?

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:53.800
Yeah.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:57.300
That's why we've been waiting for today, 
the day of the memorial ceremony.

00:17:59.450 --> 00:18:03.140
Help us, Kazuki Azuma, son of Migiwa.

00:18:03.770 --> 00:18:05.620
It's your responsibility.

00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:15.830
There's a convenience store
on the <i>roof</i> of this building?

00:18:15.830 --> 00:18:19.020
It's here for the maintenance staff.
It's unmanned.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:20.310
It's closed most of the time.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.950
What's wrong? You look pale.

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.870
I don't really like heights.

00:18:33.700 --> 00:18:35.510
Kino-chan! Shizuru-chan!

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:37.590
You're late.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:40.210
Sorry, some stuff came up...

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:42.000
Hey! What are these?

00:18:42.000 --> 00:18:43.430
They're so cute!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:51.270
So you're... the one with the heart?

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:54.340
Talk later.

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:57.090
We don't have time.
We're taking this underground.

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.610
<b>Down</b>

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.310
To the Buranki prison.

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.490
Damn... The enemy's coming.

00:19:08.000 --> 00:19:10.580
Heading for the Buranki prison?

00:19:11.160 --> 00:19:13.310
I'm afraid that's not possible.

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:15.300
Not with a bunch of kids' Bubuki.

00:19:16.850 --> 00:19:19.040
No way... No way...

00:19:19.040 --> 00:19:22.010
Have a taste of a grown-up's Bubuki.

00:19:25.050 --> 00:19:26.640
Kogane! Don't get hasty!

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:34.940
Kogane-chan!

00:19:43.100 --> 00:19:43.800
Shizuru!

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:46.700
Schwing!

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:47.950
Ka-zing!

00:20:06.730 --> 00:20:09.300
Th-This is a Bubuki?

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:11.230
Heh. Wuss.

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:13.520
Cough, cough...

00:20:15.970 --> 00:20:16.840
He's...

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:20.200
Kogane, what are you doing?! Calm down!

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:22.200
Kino-chan, let go! Let go!

00:20:24.180 --> 00:20:24.700
Crap!

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:26.530
Kinoa! Shizuru!

00:20:47.720 --> 00:20:48.760
Is this...

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:52.020
Perfect! We landed in the 
water supply culvert!

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:55.290
The Buranki prison should be just upstream.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:03.150
Just like the cowardly 
little children you are...

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:05.600
All you can do is run away.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:09.350
Kinoa, Shizuru! We'll hold him off!

00:21:09.800 --> 00:21:12.000
Don't just stand there! Go now!

00:21:12.290 --> 00:21:13.150
But...

00:21:13.150 --> 00:21:15.300
Isn't there something you need to do?!

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:20.350
Okay. I'm going.

00:21:22.150 --> 00:21:23.340
You think I'll let you?

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:35.460
You murderer! You killed my father!

00:21:35.880 --> 00:21:37.530
I won't let you kill anyone else!

00:21:37.930 --> 00:21:41.360
You won't kill anyone else I care about!

00:21:42.430 --> 00:21:43.450
Kogane-chan!

00:21:43.450 --> 00:21:45.820
Just go! You're slowing us down!

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.460
Yeah, that's right.

00:21:51.410 --> 00:21:53.380
Go revive Oubu...

00:21:53.380 --> 00:21:54.780
For me.

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.110
<i>All this time, I've been searching</i>

00:22:02.810 --> 00:22:04.930
<i>for a way to see Mom again.</i>

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:07.840
<i>With Oubu... If I have Oubu...</i>

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:10.080
<i>I can make it back up to the sky!</i>

00:23:30.470 --> 00:23:31.730
It's nothing but bones!

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:36.100
Mom's Oubu...
